.SH NAME
SystemEx.Threading.LightLock \- Provides a minimal wrapper around Monitor to offer lightweight mutual exclusion\&. \fBLightLock\fP is intended for short, low‑overhead critical sections where a full synchronization primitive would be unnecessary\&.  

